- **JDK:** `openjdk version "25.0.5" 2026-10-20 LTS`
- **Spring Boot:** 3.2.3
- **Stack:** Spring WebFlux + Reactor Netty on native epoll (G1GC, JDK 25 Leyden AOT, virtual threads disabled)
- **Virtual threads:** disabled

